Maheswaran,

You want to set the argument "family=Gamma(link=log)".  Here is an example using the log link in this model, taken from the Zelig datasets that should make for a clear example:


library("Zelig")

install.packages("ZeligMultilevel")

library("ZeligMultilevel")

data(coalition2)

z.out1 <- zelig(duration ~ invest + numst2 + tag(1 | country), data=coalition2, model="gamma.mixed", family=Gamma(link=log))

summary(z.out1)

James.

